iv>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ============================ SERVICES ============================ -->\n<section class=\"section svc-sec\" id=\"services\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"sec-head\">\n      <h2>Everything that turns a search into a booked job.</h2>\n      <p>Ads are what we do best. Everything else here exists to make those ads pay off: the page they land on, the phone that gets answered, and the listing people check before they call.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Flagship: ads lead, visually and in order -->\n    <article class=\"flag\">\n      <div class=\"flag__main\">\n        <div class=\"flag__top\"><span class=\"sic sic--d\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 15v-4a2 2 0 012-2h2l7-4v16l-7-4H5a2 2 0 01-2-2z\"/><path d=\"M18 9.5a4 4 0 010 5\"/></svg></span><span class=\"tag tag--red\">Flagship service</span></div>\n        <h3>Meta &amp; Google Ads</h3>\n        <p class=\"flag__lede\">Paid ads on Facebook, Instagram and Google Search, aimed at the jobs you want more of in the areas you actually serve. We build the campaigns, watch the numbers and adjust every month so your budget goes where the calls are.</p>\n        <ul class=\"flag__list\">\n          <li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6L9 17l-5-5\"/></svg>Campaign strategy built around the jobs you want more of</li>\n          <li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6L9 17l-5-5\"/></svg>Facebook, Instagram and Google Search</li>\n          <li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6L9 17l-5-5\"/></svg>Targeted to your service area</li>\n          <li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6L9 17l-5-5\"/></svg>Adjusted every month, reported in plain English</li>\n        </ul>\n        <div class=\"flag__cta\">\n          <a class=\"btn btn--primary btn--lg\" href=\"#start\">Book Your Free Strategy Call <svg class=\"btn__arrow\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a>\n          <p>Custom quote, based on your market and goals.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"flag__subs\">\n          <div class=\"sub\"><span class=\"sic sic--d sic--sm\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"4\" width=\"18\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2.5\"/><path d=\"M10 9.5v5l4.5-2.5z\"/></svg></span><div><h4>Ad Creative</h4><p>Graphics and short videos for your campaigns, built from your real jobs, trucks and crew.</p></div></div>\n          <div class=\"sub\"><span class=\"sic sic--d sic--sm\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 3v18h18\"/><path d=\"M7 15l4-4 3 3 5-6\"/></svg></span><div><h4>Tracking &amp; Reporting</h4><p>Performance analytics and a plain-English monthly report: what you spent, what came in, and what we&rsquo;re changing. AI-assisted targeting and reporting help spot what&rsquo;s working sooner.</p></div></div>\n          <div class=\"sub\"><span class=\"sic sic--d sic--sm\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2.5\"/><path d=\"M3 9h18M8 13h8M8 16.5h5\"/></svg></span><div><h4>Landing Pages</h4><p>The page each ad points to, built for one job: turning a click into a call. Separate from a full website build, so ads can run before a redesign.</p></div></div>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n\n    <div class=\"core\">\n      <article class=\"scard\">\n        <div class=\"scard__top\"><span class=\"sic sic--l\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"2.5\" y=\"4\" width=\"19\" height=\"15\" rx=\"2.5\"/><path d=\"M2.5 8.5h19M6 6.2h.01M8.6 6.2h.01\"/></svg></span></div>\n        <h3>Website Design &amp; Build</h3>\n        <p>A fast, mobile-first website that makes calling you the obvious next step, with on-page SEO built in. It&rsquo;s available on its own, and it&rsquo;s not a requirement for running ads with us.</p>\n        <ul class=\"chips\"><li>Mobile-first</li><li>Tap-to-call</li><li>Quote form</li><li>On-page SEO</li><li>Hosting &amp; updates</li></ul>\n        <div class=\"svc-addon\" id=\"ai-chatbot\">\n          <span class=\"sic sic--d sic--sm\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21 12a8 8 0 01-11.6 7.1L4 20l1-4.6A8 8 0 1121 12z\"/><path d=\"M8.5 12h.01M12 12h.01M15.5 12h.01\"/></svg></span>\n          <div>\n            <h4>AI Website Chatbot <span class=\"tag tag--red\">Premium add-on</span></h4>\n            <p>Answers visitor questions on your site, day or night, and hands you the lead. Add it to any website build. Try the preview in the corner of this page.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"card-foot\"><span class=\"cq\">Custom quote</span><a class=\"slink\" href=\"#start\">Book Your Free Strategy Call <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"scard\" id=\"ai-receptionist\">\n        <div class=\"scard__top\"><span class=\"sic sic--l\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 11a8 8 0 0116 0\"/><rect x=\"2.5\" y=\"11\" width=\"4.5\" height=\"7\" rx=\"2\"/><rect x=\"17\" y=\"11\" width=\"4.5\" height=\"7\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M19.2 18v.8a2.5 2.5 0 01-2.5 2.5H13\"/></svg></span><span class=\"tag tag--soft\">New</span></div>\n        <h3>AI Receptionist</h3>\n        <p>The call you miss on a roof is the job that goes to the next company. Ours answers every call you can&rsquo;t, takes the name, number and address, books the appointment and texts you the details, in your business&rsquo;s own voice.</p>\n        <ul class=\"chips\"><li>Answers 24/7</li><li>Books appointments</li><li>Texts you the details</li></ul>\n        <figure class=\"svc-example\">\n          <figcaption>Example text you&rsquo;d get</figcaption>\n          <div class=\"sms\"><p class=\"sms__from\">AI Receptionist · just now</p><p class=\"sms__txt\">New booking: furnace not heating. Tue, 9:00 AM. Name, number and address saved.</p></div>\n        </figure>\n        <div class=\"card-foot\"><span class=\"cq\">Custom quote</span><a class=\"slink\" href=\"#start\">Book Your Free Strategy Call <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></div>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"more\">\n      <h3>Also available</h3>\n      <div class=\"more__grid\">\n        <article class=\"mcard\"><span class=\"sic sic--l sic--sm\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 21s7-5.5 7-11a7 7 0 10-14 0c0 5.5 7 11 7 11z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"2.6\"/></svg></span><h4>Google Business Profile &amp; Local SEO</h4><p>Show up when someone searches your trade plus your town, in the map pack and the regular results. It all stays in your name.</p><div class=\"card-foot\"><span class=\"cq\">Custom quote</span><a class=\"slink\" href=\"#start\">Ask on your strategy call <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></div></article>\n        <article class=\"mcard\" id=\"brand-strategy\"><span class=\"sic sic--l sic--sm\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 17l6-6 4 4 8-8\"/><path d=\"M14 7h7v7\"/></svg></span><h4>Brand &amp; Growth Strategy</h4><p>A clear plan for where your business goes next: how you stand apart, what your brand says, which services to lead with, and where your marketing money should go.</p><div class=\"card-foot\"><span class=\"cq\">Custom quote</span><a class=\"slink\" href=\"#start\">Ask on your strategy call <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></div></article>\n        <article class=\"mcard\"><span class=\"sic sic--l sic--sm\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 19l7-7 3 3-7 7-3-3z\"/><path d=\"M18 13l-1.5-7.5L2 2l3.5 14.5L13 18l5-5z\"/><path d=\"M2 2l7.6 7.6\"/><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"2\"/></svg></span><h4>Logo Design</h4><p>A clean mark that reads on a truck door, a yard sign and a phone screen, delivered in every file format you&rsquo;ll need.</p><div class=\"card-foot\"><span class=\"cq\">Custom quote</span><a class=\"slink\" href=\"#start\">Ask on your strategy call <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></div></article>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"svc-cta\">\n      <p>Not sure where to start?<span>Tell us about your business and we&rsquo;ll recommend what fits on a free strategy call. No pitch deck.</span></p>\n      <a class=\"btn btn--primary btn--lg\" href=\"#start\">Book Your Free Strategy Call <svg class=\"btn__arrow\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ============================ PROCESS ============================ -->\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"process\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"sec-head\">\n      <h2>From first call to live ads, without the runaround.</h2>\n      <p>Four steps from the first call to leads coming in.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"steps\">\n      <span class=\"steps__track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"steps__fill\"></span></span>\n      <ol class=\"steps__list\">\n        <li class=\"step\">\n          <span class=\"step__node\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span>\n          <h3>We learn the jobs you want.</h3>\n          <p>Which work pays best, which towns you'll actually drive to, and how much you can take on each week. It takes one short call.</p>\n          <p class=\"step__time\">One short call</p>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"step\">\n          <span class=\"step__node\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span>\n          <h3>We build the campaigns.</h3>\n          <p>Ads written for your trade and your towns, on Facebook, Instagram and Google Search, set up so the people who see them can call you in one tap.</p>\n          <p class=\"step__time\">Built to make your phone ring</p>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"step\">\n          <span class=\"step__node\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span>\n          <h3>Your ads go live.</h3>\n          <p>Campaigns launch aimed at your service area. You set the ad budget, and every call and form goes straight to your phone.</p>\n          <p class=\"step__time\">Leads go straight to you</p>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"step\">\n          <span class=\"step__node\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span>\n          <h3>We keep adjusting.</h3>\n          <p>Ads that aren't bringing in calls get cut; the ones that are get more of the budget. Every month you get a plain-English report: what you spent, what came in, and what we're changing.</p>\n          <p class=\"step__time\">Report every month</p>\n        </li>\n      </ol>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"svc-cta cta-band\">\n      <p>Ready for step one?<span>It&rsquo;s one short call. You&rsquo;ll know what we&rsquo;d do for your business before you spend anything.</span></p>\n      <a class=\"btn btn--primary btn--lg\" href=\"#start\">Book Your Free Strategy Call <svg class=\"btn__arrow\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ============================ WHY US ============================ -->\n<section class=\"section why-sec\" id=\"why\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"sec-head\">\n      <h2>You&rsquo;ve probably been burned by an agency already.</h2>\n      <p>Agencies that go quiet after the invoice clears. Ad budgets that disappear with nothing to show for it. Here&rsquo;s how we set this up differently.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"why\">\n      <div class=\"why__points\">\n        <div class=\"point\">\n          <h3>You deal with the people doing the work.</h3>\n          <p>There&rsquo;s no account manager relaying messages and no handoff after you sign, and our founder personally oversees every project.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"point\">\n          <h3>You own everything, from day one.</h3>\n          <p>The domain is registered in your name with your email as admin. Your Google Business Profile stays in your name, and we&rsquo;re never listed as the owner. If you leave, you take all of it with you.</p>\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
