{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_19","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"sed -n '1204,1276p' weconvert-site/index.html\nsed -n '1297,1320p' weconvert-site/index.html\"","aggregated_output":"<!-- ============================ WHY US ============================ -->\n<section class=\"section why-sec\" id=\"why\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"sec-head\">\n      <h2>You&rsquo;ve probably been burned by an agency already.</h2>\n      <p>Agencies that go quiet after the invoice clears. Ad budgets that disappear with nothing to show for it. Here&rsquo;s how we set this up differently.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"why\">\n      <div class=\"why__points\">\n        <div class=\"point\">\n          <h3>You deal with the people doing the work.</h3>\n          <p>There&rsquo;s no account manager relaying messages and no handoff after you sign, and our founder personally oversees every project.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"point\">\n          <h3>You own everything, from day one.</h3>\n          <p>The domain is registered in your name with your email as admin. Your Google Business Profile stays in your name, and we&rsquo;re never listed as the owner. If you leave, you take all of it with you.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"point\">\n          <h3>Your leads stay yours.</h3>\n          <p>Every call and form from your ads and your site goes straight to your phone. It never passes through a shared lead pool that other contractors are paying for too.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"point\">\n          <h3>Built to grow with you.</h3>\n          <p>Start with ads or a website, then add an AI receptionist, local SEO or a growth strategy when the business is ready for it. You only pay for what you use.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"cmp\">\n        <table>\n          <caption>The honest comparison</caption>\n          <thead>\n            <tr><th scope=\"col\">What you&rsquo;re deciding</th><th scope=\"col\">Typical agency</th><th scope=\"col\">West Converts</th></tr>\n          </thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr><th scope=\"row\">Who you actually talk to</th><td><span class=\"ic no\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18\"/></svg>Whoever&rsquo;s assigned</span></td><td class=\"yes\"><span class=\"ic yes\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6L9 17l-5-5\"/></svg>The people doing the work</span></td></tr>\n            <tr><th scope=\"row\">Where your leads go</th><td><span class=\"ic no\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18\"/></svg>Sometimes a shared lead pool</span></td><td class=\"yes\"><span class=\"ic yes\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6L9 17l-5-5\"/></svg>Straight to your phone</span></td></tr>\n            <tr><th scope=\"row\">How ads are billed</th><td><span class=\"ic no\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18\"/></svg>A cut of your ad spend</span></td><td class=\"yes\"><span class=\"ic yes\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6L9 17l-5-5\"/></svg>A quoted monthly fee</span></td></tr>\n            <tr><th scope=\"row\">Time to a live website</th><td>6–12 weeks</td><td class=\"yes\">About a week</td></tr>\n            <tr><th scope=\"row\">Who owns the site &amp; domain</th><td><span class=\"ic no\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18\"/></svg>Often the agency</span></td><td class=\"yes\"><span class=\"ic yes\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6L9 17l-5-5\"/></svg>You do</span></td></tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ============================ FOUNDER ============================ -->\n<!-- PLACEHOLDER: swap the DT monogram for a real photo of Danny (natural light beats studio). -->\n<section class=\"section section--tint founder-sec\" id=\"about\" aria-labelledby=\"about-title\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"founder\">\n      <div>\n        <h2 id=\"about-title\">Founder-led, from the first call on.</h2>\n        <blockquote class=\"founder__quote\">&ldquo;We&rsquo;d rather give you a straight answer than walk you through a proposal. That&rsquo;s the whole pitch.&rdquo;</blockquote>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"founder__card\">\n        <div class=\"founder__photo\" aria-hidden=\"true\">DT</div>\n        <div>\n          <p class=\"founder__sig\">Danny Tellez</p>\n          <p class=\"founder__role\">Founder, West Converts</p>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"founder__bio\">I&rsquo;m a young entrepreneur based in Fort Collins, Colorado. I started West Converts so trades businesses could get marketing with straight answers and a direct line to the people doing the work. Our team runs the campaigns and builds the sites, and I personally oversee every project.</p>\n        <p class=\"founder__area\">Working with trades businesses across Northern Colorado, including Fort Collins, Loveland, Greeley, Windsor and Longmont, and expanding beyond Colorado.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ============================ CLIENTS ============================ -->\n<section class=\"clients\" id=\"clients\" aria-labelledby=\"clients-title\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <h2 id=\"clients-title\">You&rsquo;re in good company.</h2>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ============================ FAQ ============================ -->\n<section class=\"section section--tint\" id=\"faq\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"sec-head sec-head--center\">\n      <h2>The questions owners actually ask.</h2>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"faq\">\n      <div class=\"faq__item\">\n        <h3>\n          <button class=\"faq__q\" type=\"button\" id=\"faq-q1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-a1\">\n            <span>What does it cost?</span>\n            <span class=\"faq__ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\"/></svg></span>\n          </button>\n        </h3>\n        <div class=\"faq__a\" id=\"faq-a1\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-q1\">\n          <div>\n            <p>Every business is different, so everything we do is custom quoted. On a free strategy call we look at your market, your goals and what you already have, then give you a straight number.</p>\n            <p>The call is free, and there&#x27;s no obligation after it.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_20","type":"agent_message","text":"The desktop headers can pair each heading with its existing lede without adding copy. I’m also keeping the larger gutters above 1280px to avoid crowding the navigation, and adding narrow-screen wrapping to the lead card. The trust pills will retain their intentional pop effect but wait until they enter view."}}
